PAWS-AI is developed and maintained by:

  Carlos Alberto Paramio Danta — creator (2026–present)

PAWS-AI is an interpreter for the original PAWS (Professional Adventure
Writing System) engine by Graeme Yeandle and Tim Gilberts. It is a
clean-room reimplementation and is not affiliated with the original
authors.

Special thanks
--------------

  Carlos Sánchez (Uto)
      For patiently helping to untangle a few small mysteries about the
      internal and undocumented behaviour of the original PAWS engine.

Contributing
------------

If you send a patch, a bug report with a reproducible test, or a
documentation improvement, feel free to add your own line below this
point (in alphabetical order, one entry per person):

  Name <email-or-handle>  — short description of the contribution, year
